{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a full-screen "destination hero slider" block. Build an exact static layout first.
    
    OVERALL
    - Full-bleed: width 100vw (break out of any page-width container with margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw)), height 100svh, min-height 640px, position relative, overflow hidden, background #111.
    - Scope all markup, CSS and JS to a wrapper with a unique id based on block.id, so multiple instances never clash. Use plain CSS and vanilla JS only, no libraries.
    - Accent colour setting (default #ECAB32). All text is white.
    
    LAYER 1 — BACKGROUND
    - The active slide's image covers the whole block (object-fit: cover).
    - Three overlays on top of it: (a) flat black at the "overlay opacity" setting (default 25%); (b) a left-to-right gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.40) to transparent at 55%, for text legibility; (c) a top gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.35) to transparent at 20%, so a transparent theme header stays readable.
    
    LAYER 2 — TOP AUTOPLAY BAR
    - A 3px bar pinned to the very top edge. The track is transparent and the fill uses the accent colour. Start the fill at 0% width (Part 2 animates it).
    
    LAYER 3 — LEFT CONTENT (active slide)
    Left padding 5vw. Absolutely positioned: the top sits at 35% of the section height, and the bottom of the button row lines up with the bottom edge of the cards (about 82% of the height). Stack, in order:
    1. A white dash, 20px × 3px, with 18px space below.
    2. The location eyebrow (e.g. "Switzerland Alps"): body font, clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 22px), weight 300, inside an overflow:hidden mask, with 14px space below.
    3. A two-line title. Put each line in its own span inside its own overflow:hidden mask (Part 2 needs this). Use the display font, UPPERCASE, tall condensed bold (default Oswald 700, font_picker handle oswald_n7), font-size clamp(52px, 7.2vw, 112px), line-height 1.02.
    4. A description: 14px, line-height 1.75, white at 75% opacity, max-width 390px, margin 18px 0 28px.
    5. A button row, gap 16px, vertically centred:
       - Bookmark: a 38px circle filled with the accent colour, holding a white 14px bookmark SVG. Clicking it toggles a "saved" state (icon filled or outlined), client-side only.
       - A "DISCOVER LOCATION" pill: 40px tall, padding 0 28px, transparent, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), radius 999px, 11px uppercase, letter-spacing .12em, weight 500. On hover: white background, dark text. It links to the slide's button link.
    
    LAYER 4 — CARD TRACK (upcoming slides)
    - Positioned left: 41% and top: 42%. It runs off the right edge and the last visible card is cut off by the screen edge. That is intended.
    - Show every slide except the active one, in order after it, looping. Active 1 → cards 2,3,4,5,6. Active 3 → cards 4,5,6,1,2.
    - Each card is a <button>: width clamp(170px, 14.6vw, 240px), aspect-ratio 13/20, gap 1.9vw, border-radius 10px, overflow hidden, box-shadow 0 22px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35). Image object-fit cover. Bottom overlay gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.65) to transparent at 55%.
    - Card text sits bottom-left with padding 0 16px 20px: a 12px × 2px white dash; the location at 12px, white 85%; the title on 2 lines, UPPERCASE display font, 21px, line-height 1.05.
    - On hover: translateY(-6px) and a deeper shadow, over 300ms.
    
    LAYER 5 — CONTROLS ROW
    - Vertical centre at 91% of the height. The left edge lines up with the first card (41%); the right edge is 4vw from the screen edge.
    - Prev and next arrows: 60px circles, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), transparent, thin white chevron SVGs, gap 12px. On hover: white border and background rgba(255,255,255,.1).
    - A progress line fills the space between the arrows and the counter (margin 0 24px): a 1px line in rgba(255,255,255,.35) with a 2px accent fill on top. Fill width = activeIndex ÷ totalSlides, so slide 1 = 0% and slide 2 = 16.7% when there are 6 slides.
    - A counter on the right showing two digits ("01"): display font, clamp(36px, 3.6vw, 56px), inside an overflow:hidden box one line tall.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}{% assign display_font = block.settings.display_font %}
{% style %}{{ display_font | font_face }}
#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;position:relative;width:100vw;height:100svh;min-height:640px;margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);overflow:hidden;background:#111;color:#fff;isolation:isolate;font-family:{{ settings.type_body_font.family }},sans-serif}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} *,#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} *:before,#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} *:after{box-sizing:border-box}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-slide,#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-image{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-slide{opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transition:opacity .45s ease,visibility .45s ease}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-slide.is-active{opacity:1;visibility:visible}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-image{object-fit:cover}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-placeholder{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#252525}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;color:#555}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.35),transparent 20%),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.40),transparent 55%),rgba(0,0,0,{{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }})}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress-top{position:absolute;z-index:5;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:3px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress-top span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-content{position:absolute;z-index:2;left:5vw;top:35%;max-width:42vw}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-copy{display:none}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-copy.is-active{display:block}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-dash{display:block;width:20px;height:3px;margin:0 0 18px;background:#fff}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-location-mask{overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 14px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-location{font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,22px);font-weight:300;line-height:1.2}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title{margin:0;font-family:{{ display_font.family }},sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(52px,7.2vw,112px);line-height:1.02;text-transform:uppercase}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title-mask{display:block;overflow:hidden}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-description{max-width:390px;margin:18px 0 28px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);font-size:14px;line-height:1.75}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-save{width:38px;height:38px;flex:0 0 38px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};color:#fff;cursor:pointer}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-save svg{width:14px;height:14px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-discover{min-height:40px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 28px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.75);border-radius:999px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-discover:hover{background:#fff;color:#111}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-track{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:41%;top:42%;display:flex;gap:1.9vw;align-items:flex-start}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card{position:relative;flex:0 0 clamp(170px,14.6vw,240px);aspect-ratio:13/20;padding:0;overflow:hidden;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#222;color:#fff;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 22px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35);transition:transform 300ms ease,box-shadow 300ms ease}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 28px 48px rgba(0,0,0,.5)}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card img,#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card .dh-placeholder{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:35% 0 0;background:linear-gradient(transparent,rgba(0,0,0,.65) 55%)}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-copy{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:16px;right:10px;bottom:20px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-dash{display:block;width:12px;height:2px;margin-bottom:10px;background:#fff}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-location{display:block;margin-bottom:7px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);font-size:12px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-title{display:block;font-family:{{ display_font.family }},sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.05;text-transform:uppercase}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-controls{position:absolute;z-index:4;left:41%;right:4vw;top:91%;transform:translateY(-50%);display:flex;align-items:center}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow{width:60px;height:60px;flex:0 0 60px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.55);border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:#fff;cursor:pointer}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow:hover{border-color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow svg{width:19px;height:19px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress{flex:1;height:1px;margin:0 24px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.35)}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress span{display:block;width:0;height:2px;margin-top:-.5px;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-counter{width:78px;height:1.2em;overflow:hidden;flex:0 0 78px;font-family:{{ display_font.family }},sans-serif;font-size:clamp(36px,3.6vw,56px);line-height:1.1;font-weight:700;text-align:right}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-counter span{display:block}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} button:focus-visible,#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:4px}@media(max-width:749px){#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-content{left:6vw;top:24%;max-width:84vw}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title{font-size:clamp(48px,13vw,76px)}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-description{max-width:320px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card-track{left:6vw;top:auto;bottom:15%;gap:14px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card{flex-basis:145px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-controls{left:6vw;right:6vw;top:auto;bottom:3%;transform:none}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow{width:46px;height:46px;flex-basis:46px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress{margin:0 12px}#destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-counter{flex-basis:52px;width:52px}}
{% endstyle %}
<destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} id="destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><div class="dh-progress-top"><span></span></div><div class="dh-slides">{% for i in (1..6) %}{% assign image_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_image' %}{% assign slide_image = block.settings[image_key] %}<div class="dh-slide{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}">{% if slide_image %}<img class="dh-image" src="{{ slide_image | image_url: width: 2400 }}" alt="{{ slide_image.alt | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ slide_image.width }}" height="{{ slide_image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="dh-placeholder">{{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}</div>{% endfor %}</div><div class="dh-overlay"></div><div class="dh-content">
{% for i in (1..6) %}{% assign loc_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_location' %}{% assign l1 = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_line_one' %}{% assign l2 = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_line_two' %}{% assign desc = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_description' %}{% assign link = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_link' %}<article class="dh-copy{% if forloop.first %} is-active{% endif %}"><span class="dh-dash"></span><div class="dh-location-mask"><div class="dh-location">{{ block.settings[loc_key] | escape }}</div></div><h1 class="dh-title"><span class="dh-title-mask"><span>{{ block.settings[l1] | escape }}</span></span><span class="dh-title-mask"><span>{{ block.settings[l2] | escape }}</span></span></h1><p class="dh-description">{{ block.settings[desc] | escape }}</p><div class="dh-actions"><button type="button" class="dh-save" aria-label="Save destination" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3.75h12v17l-6-4-6 4v-17Z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><a class="dh-discover" href="{{ block.settings[link] | default: '#' }}">Discover location</a></div></article>{% endfor %}</div><div class="dh-card-track">
{% for i in (1..6) %}{% assign image_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_image' %}{% assign loc_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_location' %}{% assign l1 = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_line_one' %}{% assign l2 = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_line_two' %}{% assign slide_image = block.settings[image_key] %}<button type="button" class="dh-card" data-card="{{ i | minus: 1 }}" aria-label="Show {{ block.settings[loc_key] | escape }}">{% if slide_image %}<img src="{{ slide_image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="" loading="lazy" width="{{ slide_image.width }}" height="{{ slide_image.height }}">{% else %}<div class="dh-placeholder">{{ 'hero-apparel-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>{% endif %}<span class="dh-card-copy"><span class="dh-card-dash"></span><span class="dh-card-location">{{ block.settings[loc_key] | escape }}</span><span class="dh-card-title">{{ block.settings[l1] | escape }}<br>{{ block.settings[l2] | escape }}</span></span></button>{% endfor %}</div><div class="dh-controls"><button type="button" class="dh-arrow dh-prev" aria-label="Previous destination"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m15 5-7 7 7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></button><button type="button" class="dh-arrow dh-next" aria-label="Next destination"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 5 7 7-7 7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg></button><div class="dh-progress"><span></span></div><div class="dh-counter" aria-live="polite"><span>01</span></div></div></destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){const tag='destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class DestinationHero extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.index=0;this.slides=[...this.querySelectorAll('.dh-slide')];this.copies=[...this.querySelectorAll('.dh-copy')];this.cards=[...this.querySelectorAll('.dh-card')];this.track=this.querySelector('.dh-card-track');this.fill=this.querySelector('.dh-progress span');this.querySelector('.dh-prev').addEventListener('click',()=>this.show(this.index-1));this.querySelector('.dh-next').addEventListener('click',()=>this.show(this.index+1));this.cards.forEach(c=>c.addEventListener('click',()=>this.show(+c.dataset.card)));this.querySelectorAll('.dh-save').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const on=b.getAttribute('aria-pressed')==='true';b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(!on));b.setAttribute('aria-label',on?'Save destination':'Remove saved destination');b.querySelector('path').setAttribute('fill',on?'none':'currentColor')}));this.show(0)}show(n){this.index=(n+this.slides.length)%this.slides.length;this.slides.forEach((e,i)=>e.classList.toggle('is-active',i===this.index));this.copies.forEach((e,i)=>e.classList.toggle('is-active',i===this.index));const order=[];for(let j=1;j<this.cards.length;j++)order.push((this.index+j)%this.cards.length);order.push(this.index);order.forEach(i=>this.track.appendChild(this.cards[i]));this.fill.style.width=(this.index/this.slides.length*100)+'%';this.querySelector('.dh-counter span').textContent=String(this.index+1).padStart(2,'0')}}customElements.define(tag,DestinationHero)})();</script>
{% schema %}{"name":"Destination hero slider","settings":[{"type":"header","content":"Style"},{"type":"color","id":"accent_color","label":"Accent color","default":"#ECAB32"},{"type":"range","id":"overlay_opacity","label":"Overlay opacity","min":0,"max":60,"step":5,"unit":"%","default":25},{"type":"font_picker","id":"display_font","label":"Display font","default":"oswald_n7"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 1"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_1_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_1_location","label":"Location","default":"Swiss Alps"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_1_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Beyond"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_1_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"The Peaks"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_1_description","label":"Description","default":"Discover a quieter kind of adventure among the timeless alpine peaks."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_1_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 2"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_2_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_2_location","label":"Location","default":"Amalfi Coast"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_2_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Coastal"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_2_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"Daydream"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_2_description","label":"Description","default":"Follow the sun along dramatic cliffs and bright Mediterranean waters."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_2_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 3"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_3_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_3_location","label":"Location","default":"Marrakech, Morocco"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_3_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Into The"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_3_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"Red City"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_3_description","label":"Description","default":"Find color, craft and the pulse of a city shaped by centuries of stories."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_3_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 4"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_4_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_4_location","label":"Location","default":"Kyoto, Japan"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_4_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Quiet"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_4_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"Traditions"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_4_description","label":"Description","default":"Wander serene gardens and winding lanes where old and new meet."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_4_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 5"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_5_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_5_location","label":"Location","default":"Patagonia, Chile"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_5_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Wild At"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_5_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"The Edge"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_5_description","label":"Description","default":"Take the long way through vast landscapes and untamed wilderness."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_5_link","label":"Button link"},{"type":"header","content":"Slide 6"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"slide_6_image","label":"Image"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_6_location","label":"Location","default":"Bali, Indonesia"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_6_line_one","label":"Title line one","default":"Island"},{"type":"text","id":"slide_6_line_two","label":"Title line two","default":"State Of Mind"},{"type":"textarea","id":"slide_6_description","label":"Description","default":"Let the warm island rhythm make room for a little more wonder."},{"type":"url","id":"slide_6_link","label":"Button link"}],"presets":[{"name":"Destination hero slider"}],"tag":null,"class":"destination-hero-block"}{% endschema %}